        "created_at": "2021-10-18T20:11:33.716Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6\" title=\"Screenshot_20211018-150159\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20211018-150159\" data-base62-sha1=\"6cfbOQsRGeenGuldcGcnC4JMmz4\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/2/2b6f64bab726e817469505f5784097d3caf8c9a6_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20211018-150159</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 194 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>Had to settle for Near Mint, because I was dumb and left all of Luminary’s cards in his trash at the worst possible moment.</p>\n<p>On the second try, I flipped WM just so i could use the Terralunar Translocator to clear off those pesky face down Condition cards; after that, it was just a matter of putting enough damage on the little lunatic to finish him. Biggest hit was Setback with 13 tokens and double High Risk Behaviors playing Cause And Effect - but it was overkill by that time, despite the 2 points of damage reduction.</p>",
